msgid ""
"<h1>Welcome!</h1>\n"
"<p>There are many media-players around these days, this is true. But what's "
"missing from most players is an interface that doesn't get in your way. How "
"many buttons do you have to press when simply adding media to the playlist? "
"amaroK tries to be a little different, providing a simple drag-and-drop "
"interface that makes playlist handling really easy.</p>\n"
"<p align=\"right\"><i>\"amaroK is seriously super!\"</i> - Uncle Rodney</p>\n"
"<h2>First-run Wizard</h2>\n"
"<p>This wizard will help you setup amaroK in three easy steps. Click "
"<i>Next</i> to begin, or if you do not like wizards, click <i>Skip</i>.</p>"
msgstr ""

