"Single window with player and playlist\n"
"functionality combined\n"
"(like JuK)"
msgstr ""

#. i18n: file ./firstrunwizard.ui line 176
#: rc.cpp:102
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"<p>"
"With amaroK you can use the interface that you find most comfortable. The "
"choices are listed below and an example screenshot is shown on their right. "
"You can change these settings at a later time using the amaroK configuration "
"dialog.</p>"
msgstr ""

#. i18n: file ./firstrunwizard.ui line 233
#: rc.cpp:106
#, no-c-format
msgid "[2] Collection"
msgstr ""

#. i18n: file ./firstrunwizard.ui line 253
#: rc.cpp:109
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"<p>Your <b>Collection</b>"
" is a database of media, with which you can quickly and easily find your \n"
"music using queries based on the media's tags.</p>\n"
"<p>Here you should select which folders to search for media, amaroK will "
"begin the search when this wizard is complete. If you choose to \n"
"<i>Monitor Changes</i>"
", amaroK will be notified when changes are made to the contents of these "
"folders and will update the \n"
"Collection accordingly.</p>\n"
"<p>You can change the configuration of the Collection at a future time from "
"the <i>Actions</i> menu in the \n"
"<b>Collection-browser</b>.</p>"
msgstr ""

#. i18n: file ./firstrunwizard.ui line 263
#: rc.cpp:118
#, fuzzy, no-c-format
msgid "[3] Database"
msgstr "Cronfa ddata"

#. i18n: file ./firstrunwizard.ui line 308
#: rc.cpp:121
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"A database is needed by amaroK to store information about your "
"<b>Collection</b>. If your not sure what that means, do not worry as the "
"default is <b>sqlite</b> and requires no configuration. <b>MySQL</b> is "
"faster, but requires additional setup. Detailed instructions for configuring "
"MySQL are at the <a "
"href=\"http://amarok.kde.org/wiki/index.php/MySQL_HowTo\">amaroK wiki</a>."
msgstr ""

#. i18n: file ./firstrunwizard.ui line 323
#: rc.cpp:124
